    Edit('replace', 'Your previous response (an offer/question vs a delivered answer) is CONTEXT ONLY. ALWAYS classify message_type from the current message\'s own content using the test below — never skip it. Whether a reply accepts or declines a prior offer is reconciled DOWNSTREAM by code from is_affirmative + selection_context; your job is only honest classification. message_type and is_affirmative are INDEPENDENT axes — a leading "no" sets is_affirmative=false but does NOT by itself force casual.\n\nOtherwise decide message_type, in order:', 'message_type and is_affirmative are INDEPENDENT: a leading "no" sets is_affirmative=false but does NOT by itself force casual. Classify message_type from the current message alone (the previous response, an offer or a delivered answer, is context only), by this test, in order:'),
