    # lever 2 + 4: dropped "top 3 salesman for Sorento brand last month" (same case as the kept 
    Edit('replace', '  - "top 3 salesman for Sorento brand last month" -> order_status "sales_ranking",\n    group_by "sales_agent", top_n 3, entities [Sorento as brand]\n  - "who\'s the top 3 salesman for sorento water closet this year" -> sales_ranking,\n    group_by "sales_agent", top_n 3, measure null, [sorento as brand, water closet as category]\n  - "which location sold most SR1234 in September" -> group_by "warehouse", top_n 1,\n    entities [SR1234 as product]\n  - "top 5 customers for Cabana this year" -> group_by "customer", top_n 5, Cabana as brand\n  - "sales by month for agent SA01 2026" -> group_by "month", SA01 as sales_agent\n  - "bottom 5 sales agents" -> group_by "sales_agent", top_n 5, rank_direction "bottom"\n  - "how much did we sell of Cabana in August" -> group_by null (a total), Cabana as brand', '  - "who\'s the top 3 salesman for sorento water closet this year" -> order_status "sales_ranking", group_by "sales_agent", top_n 3, measure null, [sorento as brand, water closet as category]\n  - "which location sold most SR1234 in September" -> group_by "warehouse", top_n 1, [SR1234 as product]\n  - "top 5 customers for Cabana this year" -> group_by "customer", top_n 5, Cabana as brand\n  - "sales by month for agent SA01 2026" -> group_by "month", SA01 as sales_agent\n  - "bottom 5 sales agents" -> group_by "sales_agent", top_n 5, rank_direction "bottom"\n  - "how much did we sell of Cabana in August" -> group_by null (a total), Cabana as brand'),
    # lever 1 + 4: the two "the ranked noun is never an entity" sentences merged (every noun of 
    Edit('replace', 'group_by also takes "sales_agent", "brand", "category", "channel" (dealer / project);\nlocation -> "warehouse". A named brand, sales agent or category is an entity\n{hint: "brand" | "sales_agent" | "category"}, never a customer. The ranked noun\n(salesman, sales agent, SA, rep, customer(s), account(s)) is never an entity of ANY hint, whatever\nwas asked before. In any language or mix, the ranked noun (customer, 客户, 经销商, dealer, 业务员) is never an entity: "哪一位customer sell最多 X" -> group_by "customer", entities [X as product] only. basis "delivered" or\n"ordered" only when said, else null; "by outstanding", "outstanding" or "not yet delivered"\n-> basis "outstanding". sales_channel as for sales_report.\nmeasure "qty" only when the message names quantity, qty, units or pcs; "amount" when it\nnames amount, RM or value; else measure null.', 'group_by also takes "sales_agent", "brand", "category", "channel" (dealer / project); location -> "warehouse". A named brand, sales agent or category is an entity {hint: "brand" | "sales_agent" | "category"}, never a customer. The ranked noun (salesman, sales agent, SA, rep, customer(s), account(s), 客户, 经销商, dealer, 业务员; any language or mix) is never an entity of ANY hint, whatever was asked before: "哪一位customer sell最多 X" -> group_by "customer", entities [X as product] only. basis "delivered" or "ordered" only when said; "by outstanding", "outstanding" or "not yet delivered" -> basis "outstanding". measure "qty" only when the message names quantity, qty, units or pcs; "amount" when it names amount, RM or value. sales_channel as for sales_report.'),
    # lever 4 + 5: wrapped lines joined; the three answer -> basis pairs (each value is its own 
    Edit('replace', 'A ranking of PEOPLE or ACCOUNTS ("top N customers", "top N salesman", "bottom 5 sales agents")\nis ALWAYS order_status "sales_ranking" with its own group_by, even while a top selling\nquestion ("By quantity or by amount?") is open: a new ask, not a reply to that question.\n  - answering "How many? For example top 5." with "5", "top 5" or "five" -> order_status\n    "sales_ranking", top_n 5\n  - after "Delivered, ordered or outstanding?": "delivered" -> basis "delivered"; "ordered" ->\n    basis "ordered"; "outstanding" -> basis "outstanding"; entities [], every other key null', 'A ranking of PEOPLE or ACCOUNTS ("top N customers", "top N salesman", "bottom 5 sales agents") is ALWAYS order_status "sales_ranking" with its own group_by, a new ask even while a top selling question ("By quantity or by amount?") is open, not a reply to it.\n  - "How many? For example top 5." answered "5", "top 5" or "five" -> order_status "sales_ranking", top_n 5\n  - "Delivered, ordered or outstanding?" answered "delivered", "ordered" or "outstanding" -> basis that word; entities [], every other key null'),
