    Edit('replace', '  - "when will X arrive at the warehouse" / "X什么时候会到仓库" / "X什么时候到仓库" / "bila X sampai gudang" / "bila X masuk gudang" -> ["warehouse_arrival_date"] (a WAREHOUSE is named: that one checkpoint, NOT the ETA, NOT the whole timeline).', '  - "when will X arrive at the warehouse" / "X什么时候到仓库" / "bila X sampai gudang" / "bila X masuk gudang" -> ["warehouse_arrival_date"] (a WAREHOUSE named: that checkpoint only, not the ETA or the timeline).'),
    # lever 4: terse; every example and value kept.
    Edit('replace', '  - A PRODUCT is named and no warehouse or other checkpoint: "when is X arriving" / "when will X come in" / "X什么时候到" / "bila X sampai" -> [] (the ETA default).\n  - A CONTAINER or shipment is named and no checkpoint: "incoming TIIU6323920" / "TIIU6323920" / "container status of X" / "X的状态" / "status kontena X" -> ["__all__"]. An explicit ETA ask about a container, "when does container X arrive" / "ETA of X", -> ["estimated_arrival_date"].\n  FULL TIMELINE — the SINGLE sentinel ["__all__"] and nothing else when the user wants the WHOLE picture rather than one date: "what\'s the status of container X", "full status", "all the dates", "the timeline", "everything on this shipment".\n  A bare "where is my shipment" / "when is it coming" asks only for the ETA: requested_attributes [].', '  - A PRODUCT named, no warehouse or other checkpoint ("when is X arriving" / "when will X come in" / "X什么时候到" / "bila X sampai") -> [] (the ETA default).\n  - A CONTAINER or shipment named, no checkpoint ("incoming TIIU6323920" / "TIIU6323920" / "container status of X" / "X的状态" / "status kontena X") -> ["__all__"]; an explicit container ETA ask ("when does container X arrive" / "ETA of X") -> ["estimated_arrival_date"].\n  FULL TIMELINE — only the sentinel ["__all__"] for the WHOLE picture ("what\'s the status of container X", "full status", "all the dates", "the timeline", "everything on this shipment"). A bare "where is my shipment" / "when is it coming" asks only for the ETA: [].'),
