    # lever 4: terse; every trigger word and value kept.
    Edit('replace', '  - categories: each KIND of product named, in English, without the brand and without "only", "for", "category"; a number inside a category name keeps it a category. A product TYPE is never a product entity.\n  - all_categories: true for every category ("all", "all categories", "everything", "semua", "全部"); else null.\n  - brands: brand words from the Brand candidates block, as written.\n  - suppliers: a supplier, vendor or factory NAME to filter by ("from <supplier name>", "<supplier name> only", "pembekal X", "供应商 X"), as written; "supplier" or "vendor" alone is never a name.\n  - group_by, the report\'s split: "by supplier", "per vendor", "group them by supplier", "split by supplier", "supplier-wise", "ikut pembekal", "按供应商" -> "supplier"; "by category", "per type", "ikut kategori", "按类别" -> "category"; BOTH named as the split -> "supplier_category"; "by brand", "split by brand", "ikut jenama", "按品牌" -> "brand"; "by warehouse", "per location", "ikut gudang" -> "warehouse"; "no grouping", "one list" -> "none"; nothing said -> null. A supplier NAME is a filter, never a grouping.', '  - categories: each KIND of product named, in English, without the brand and without "only", "for", "category" (a number inside a category name keeps it a category); a product TYPE is never a product entity.\n  - all_categories: true for every category ("all", "all categories", "everything", "semua", "全部"), else null.\n  - brands: brand words from the Brand candidates block, as written.\n  - suppliers: a supplier, vendor or factory NAME to filter by ("from <supplier name>", "<supplier name> only", "pembekal X", "供应商 X"), as written; "supplier" or "vendor" alone is no name.\n  - group_by (the report\'s split): "by supplier", "per vendor", "group them by supplier", "split by supplier", "supplier-wise", "ikut pembekal", "按供应商" -> "supplier"; "by category", "per type", "ikut kategori", "按类别" -> "category"; BOTH named as the split -> "supplier_category"; "by brand", "split by brand", "ikut jenama", "按品牌" -> "brand"; "by warehouse", "per location", "ikut gudang" -> "warehouse"; "no grouping", "one list" -> "none"; nothing said -> null. A supplier NAME is a filter, never a grouping.'),
