    # lever 4: terse; every trigger, value and example kept. Pass 6: tighter.
    Edit('replace', 'REFINING THE REPORT JUST SHOWN: when "Previous response" starts "Low stock report (", a message naming only a filter or grouping ("<supplier name> only", "by supplier", "sorento only", "just water closet", "ikut kategori") is the same ask: intent_hint "low_stock_report", domain_hint "inventory", domain_in_message false, only the low_stock fields it names. Naming the report itself ("low stock report", "low stock for basin") is a new ask: domain_in_message true.\nANSWERING THE BOT\'S LOW STOCK QUESTION: an Open question with "about": "low_stock_report" asks for the filter named in "owed". An answer: intent_hint "low_stock_report", domain_hint "inventory", message_type "business_query", the low_stock fields it names, open_question_answer mode "fill" (a category, supplier or grouping named), "pick" with picked (a number or an option named), "all" ("all", "any", "semua", "全部") or "cancel" ("cancel", "never mind", "batal"). "water tap by supplier" fills both fields. Something else ("stock for CB100", "my outstanding") is mode null, read as usual; "clear", "start over", "reset" -> mode null, topic_reset true.', 'REFINING THE REPORT JUST SHOWN ("Previous response" starts "Low stock report ("): only a filter or grouping ("<supplier name> only", "by supplier", "sorento only", "just water closet", "ikut kategori") = the same ask (intent_hint "low_stock_report", domain_hint "inventory", domain_in_message false, only the low_stock fields it names); naming the report itself ("low stock report", "low stock for basin") = a new ask, domain_in_message true.\nANSWERING THE BOT\'S LOW STOCK QUESTION (an Open question with "about": "low_stock_report", the filter named in "owed"): intent_hint "low_stock_report", domain_hint "inventory", message_type "business_query", the low_stock fields it names, open_question_answer mode "fill" (a category, supplier or grouping; "water tap by supplier" fills both), "pick" with picked (a number or an option named), "all" ("all", "any", "semua", "全部") or "cancel" ("cancel", "never mind", "batal"). Something else ("stock for CB100", "my outstanding") -> mode null, read as usual; "clear", "start over", "reset" -> mode null, topic_reset true.'),
