    # lever 4: arrow form; every trigger and value kept. Pass 9: the line's contents description
    Edit('replace', 'A line beginning "Open task:" in the user block = the assistant is still collecting something (a stock check waiting on a quantity per product); it names what is noted and what is still needed.\n  - A quantity for a product the open task names sets that product\'s entities[].quantity, WHATEVER the current subject ("MSK11A-QT 110" two turns after a promotion question).\n  - "add SRTWC8517", "also check SRTWC8517" -> that product as a new entity.\n  - "drop ABC123", "skip ABC123", "forget ABC123" -> entity_op "modify" with ABC123 as the entity.\n  - "make MHS1028 80" -> that product at quantity 80, REPLACING the earlier one.\n  - "just proceed", "go ahead", "check what you have", "teruskan" -> proceed_anyway true, entities empty.\n  - "never mind the stock check", "forget the stock check" -> topic_reset true, domain_hint "inventory"; a "never mind" aimed at something ELSE keeps its own domain.\n  - "back to the stock check", "what were we checking" -> domain_hint "inventory", intent_hint "check_stock", entities empty, no quantity.\nproceed_anyway is null unless the turn says it: never inferred from a short reply, silence, or a number.', '"Open task:" line in the user block = the assistant is still collecting something (a stock check waiting on a quantity per product).\n  - a quantity for a product it names -> that product\'s entities[].quantity, WHATEVER the current subject ("MSK11A-QT 110" two turns after a promotion question)\n  - "add SRTWC8517", "also check SRTWC8517" -> that product as a new entity\n  - "drop ABC123", "skip ABC123", "forget ABC123" -> entity_op "modify", ABC123 the entity\n  - "make MHS1028 80" -> that product at 80, REPLACING the earlier quantity\n  - "just proceed", "go ahead", "check what you have", "teruskan" -> proceed_anyway true, entities empty\n  - "never mind the stock check", "forget the stock check" -> topic_reset true, domain_hint "inventory" (a "never mind" aimed ELSEWHERE keeps its domain)\n  - "back to the stock check", "what were we checking" -> domain_hint "inventory", intent_hint "check_stock", entities empty, no quantity\nproceed_anyway is null unless said: never inferred from a short reply, silence, or a number.'),
